{"id":"contributor-cad-mug-v1","task":"contributor-cad-mug","object":"cad_mug","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","contributor":"scripts/record_session.py, through the page in Chrome (recorded)","status":"approved","score":1.0,"checks":[{"id":"height","result":true,"description":"height within 8.5-11.5 cm; got 9.4 cm"},{"id":"mass","result":true,"description":"mass within 0.25-0.45 kg for a real mug; got 0.300 kg"},{"id":"cavity-open","result":true,"description":"the opening holds dropped objects; 5 of 5 spheres inside"},{"id":"rests-upright","result":true,"description":"rests upright on a flat bench; tilt 0.0 deg, speed 0.0"}],"sim_asset":{"id":"@local/genesis-workbench/sim-assets/cad_mug","version":4,"metadata":{"object":"cad_mug","kind":"mesh","label":"mug","passed":true,"acceptance":{"height":true,"mass":true,"cavity-open":true,"rests-upright":true},"agent_edits":6,"approval_note":"Looks and feels like the real one now."}},"video":"videos/cad_mug.mp4","title":"Mug, rebuilt at 0.7\u00d7 scale","scene":"scenes/cad_mug","events":[{"t":0.0,"type":"action","action":"look","text":"Looked at the mug.","i":1,"traced":false,"result":null,"state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":3.7,"type":"action","action":"lift","text":"It weighs 0.20 kg, about as heavy as an apple. It stands 6.2 cm tall and is 11.6 cm by 9.0 cm across.","i":2,"traced":false,"result":{"mass_kg":0.2033,"height_cm":6.2,"across_cm":[11.6,9.0]},"state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":13.4,"type":"say","text":"This mug is tiny, like an espresso cup next to my hand. It should be a normal coffee mug.","state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":15.9,"type":"tool","tool":"inspect","args":{},"state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":16.1,"type":"tool","tool":"last_interaction","args":{"count":3},"state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":16.2,"type":"tool","tool":"source_photo","args":{},"state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":20.7,"type":"agent","text":"I can see why it looks small. The CAD is 6.2 cm tall and 11.6 cm wide including the handle. The shape matches the photos, so I only need to fix the size. A typical coffee mug is about 8\u201310 cm tall.\n\nCould you measure your real mug? I need two numbers:\n1. Its height, with the rim to the table.\n2. Its weight, if you have a kitchen scale.\n\nI'll scale the model to that height and then check that the mass is realistic.","state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":29.4,"type":"say","text":"It's a wide ceramic coffee mug: about 9.4 cm tall and 12 cm across the rim, 16 cm including the handle. It weighs around 300 g.","state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[]}},{"t":36.0,"type":"edit","tool":"set_scale","args":{"factor":1.4},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":38.6,"type":"edit","tool":"set_shell","args":{"part":"body","thickness":0.004},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":40.6,"type":"edit","tool":"set_shell","args":{"part":"body"},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":41.5,"type":"edit","tool":"set_inertial","args":{"link":"body","mass":0.3},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":43.4,"type":"tool","tool":"run_probe","args":{"kind":"rest"},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":44.2,"type":"tool","tool":"run_probe","args":{"kind":"cavity"},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":48.9,"type":"agent","text":"I scaled the mug up by 1.4\u00d7 and set its mass to 0.30 kg.\n\n- **Size:** it now measures 8.7 cm tall, 12.6 cm across and 16.3 cm including the handle. A uniform scale can't match all three of your numbers. I fitted the width and handle length, so the height is about 0.7 cm under your 9.4 cm. If you'd rather match the height, I can use 1.5\u00d7. That makes it about 13 cm across and 17.6 cm with the handle.\n- **Mass:** scaling the CAD alone made it 0.56 kg, because the walls scale up too. I set it to 0.30 kg to match your scale reading. The centre of mass is unchanged, at about 3.6 cm up.\n- **Probes:** it sits flat and stable. Balls dropped into the opening land inside, so the mug is still open.\n\nPlease lift and look at it again and tell me whether it now matches your hand-held mug, or whether you want the 1.5\u00d7 version.","state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":55.5,"type":"action","action":"lift","text":"It weighs 0.30 kg, about as heavy as a can of soda. It stands 8.7 cm tall and is 16.3 cm by 12.6 cm across.","i":3,"traced":false,"result":{"mass_kg":0.3,"height_cm":8.7,"across_cm":[16.3,12.6]},"state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":63.9,"type":"say","text":"Still not right: it's 8.7 cm tall, and the real one is about 9.4 cm.","state":{"scale":1.4,"removed":[]}},{"t":66.9,"type":"edit","tool":"set_scale","args":{"factor":1.516},"state":{"scale":1.516,"removed":[]}},{"t":67.9,"type":"edit","tool":"set_inertial","args":{"link":"body","mass":0.3},"state":{"scale":1.516,"removed":[]}},{"t":70.8,"type":"tool","tool":"run_probe","args":{"kind":"rest"},"state":{"scale":1.516,"removed":[]}},{"t":75.1,"type":"agent","text":"I rescaled the mug to 1.516\u00d7, so it is now 9.4 cm tall.\n\n- **Mass:** rescaling reset the mass to 0.71 kg, so I set it back to 0.30 kg to match your scale reading.\n- **Footprint:** a uniform scale makes the rest bigger too. The model is now 13.6 cm across and 17.6 cm including the handle. That is about 1.6 cm wider than your rim and 1.6 cm longer than your handle measurement. This CAD is a bit squatter than your real mug, and I can't fix that without distorting it.\n- **Probe:** it sits flat and stable.\n\nPlease lift it again. If you'd rather split the difference, for example a 9.0 cm height with a 13 cm rim, I can use about 1.45\u00d7. Otherwise, approve it if this looks right.","state":{"scale":1.516,"removed":[]}},{"t":81.7,"type":"action","action":"lift","text":"It weighs 0.30 kg, about as heavy as a can of soda. It stands 9.4 cm tall and is 17.6 cm by 13.6 cm across.","i":4,"traced":false,"result":{"mass_kg":0.3,"height_cm":9.4,"across_cm":[17.6,13.6]},"state":{"scale":1.516,"removed":[]}},{"t":89.6,"type":"action","action":"lean","text":"On